WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.744
Today is one word. It is a hard one, so it gets a whole day.

2
00:00:04.194 --> 00:00:06.773
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

3
00:00:07.273 --> 00:00:08.631
Say the word. Was.

4
00:00:12.177 --> 00:00:13.206
The word is was.

5
00:00:13.906 --> 00:00:15.618
Only the first letter plays fair.

6
00:00:16.068 --> 00:00:18.712
The middle letter makes the soft sound from day three.

7
00:00:19.162 --> 00:00:21.868
The last letter buzzes, as it did on day two.

8
00:00:22.318 --> 00:00:26.882
Two hearts. Your child has met both of them before. Ask where each one was.

9
00:00:27.332 --> 00:00:31.724
Then step away. In job two, every sentence has today's word in it.

10
00:00:32.174 --> 00:00:35.636
At the end, your child reads three words to you. Mark each one.
